      "text": "endPoint = 0 , count;\nint index = 0 ;\n\nwhile(index<n){\n    int farthest = -1;\n    while(index<n and clips[index][0]<=endPoint){\n        farthest = max(farthest ,clips[index][1])\n        index++;\n    }\n    if(farthest<=endPoint or farthest==-1) return -1\n    \n    endPoint=farthest\n    count++;\n    \n}\n if(endPoint>=T) return count \nreturn -1;",
