      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788593500834,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\nAlgorithms\n\n1) sort based on early finsh (last days)\n2) keep adding course\n3) if daysTokenTillNow > currentCourse.duration\n    remove maximum taking duration wala course\n    so that we can add more course using this short duration\n    wala course\n\n4) return length of maxHeap",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\nAlgorithms\n\n1) sort based on early finsh (last days)\n2) keep adding course\n3) if daysTokenTillNow > currentCourse.duration\n    remove maximum taking duration wala course\n    so that we can add more course using this short duration\n    wala course\n\n4) return length of maxHeap",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
